{"id":"5cc36f6fedab6487","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/518_正规模态逻辑_K.md","title":"518 正规模态逻辑 K","display":"518_正规模态逻辑_K","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限幂集记号定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对象语言的原始构造子只有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号约定为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\n(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\n(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下符号不是原始构造子，而是缩写：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\n\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\n\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span> 为满足下列闭包条件的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{518}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{518})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{518}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{518})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{518}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言没有绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{518}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{518}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{518}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{518}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span> 成立，并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,518}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{518},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,518}B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,518}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{518},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,518}B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是同一棵构造树。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>定义有限支撑命题替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{518}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{518})\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{518}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{518})\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{518}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{518}\\)</span> 的扩张定义为函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,-):\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,-):\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由下列构造子子句唯一给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{518}(\\sigma,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<p>命题 Hilbert 公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{518}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{518}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{518}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{518}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{518}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{518}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>假常元公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{518}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{518}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>正规分配公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{518}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{518}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目的总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{518}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{518}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{518}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{518}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{518}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{518}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{518}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{518}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{518}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{518}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{518}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{518}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>分离规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>分离规则是关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{518}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{518}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其形式关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{518}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{518}\n=\n\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在带假设证明中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{518}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{518}\\)</span> 只能作用于依赖集为空的较早行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}\\)</span>。一个从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"518\">\\(518\\)</span>-证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，并且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma),\n\\qquad\nA_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma),\n\\qquad\nA_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每一行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 必须满足以下四种理由之一。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>假设行：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>公理行：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{518}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{518}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>分离行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{518}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{518}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>必然化行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{518}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{518}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{518}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{518}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足这些条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 的集合。</p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{518}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{518}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{518}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{518}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{518}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{518}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{518}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{518}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{518}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{518}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义定理集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{518}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{518}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{518}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{518}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>此系统的目标特征是只加入正规模态公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{518}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{518}\\)</span> 与必然化规则。总公理集合被穷尽定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{518}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{518}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{518}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{518}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{518}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{518}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{518}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{518}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{518}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{518}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{518}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{518}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4\">\\(4\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"5\">\\(5\\)</span> 都不是本条目的原始新增公理族。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{518}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{518},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{518},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{518},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{518},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,518},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{518},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{518},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{518},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{518},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{518},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{518},\n\\vdash_{518}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K_{518}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{518},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{518},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{518},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{518},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,518},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{518},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{518},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{518},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{518},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{518},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{518},\n\\vdash_{518}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含命题模态句法、命题替换、公理集合、推理规则、证明对象和可证性关系；不含框架、可达关系、赋值、满足、有效性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{box}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\n(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\n\\qquad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\n\\qquad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,","display":true},{"tex":"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{518}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{518}","display":false},{"